{"openIssues": 0, "changelog": [{"tagName": "9-2.1.0", "name": "v2.1.0", "createdAt": "2026-03-25T18:35:35Z", "body": "修复系统上有应用双开账户时无法使用系统 API 卸载应用的问题。\r\n这个问题很久了，这个模块存在的时候就有这个问题，终于找到办法修了。\r\n新增作用域 `com.miui.securitycore`\r\n\r\nFixed an issue where apps couldn't be uninstalled using the system API when XSpace accounts exist.\r\nThis issue has been around for a long time, existing since the module's inception. A solution has finally been found.\r\nAdded the scope `com.miui.securitycore`.", "assets": [{"name": "HyperPMChoose-2.1.0.9-release.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/io.github.howard20181.hyperos.pmunlock/releases/download/9-2.1.0/HyperPMChoose-2.1.0.9-release.apk", "size": 47179, "downloadCount": 96}]}, {"tagName": "7-2.0.0", "name": "v2.0.0", "createdAt": "2026-03-25T07:45:58Z", "body": "支持 API 101\r\n支持锁定默认包安装器到第三方包安装器\r\n支持解锁打开的默认应用商店\r\n\r\nSupports API 101\r\nSupports locking the default installer to a third-party installer\r\nSupports unlocking the default app store\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n  <picture>\r\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\r\n      srcset=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8cc9cd0c-2f2e-4c16-9e6e-3014a0b08834\" />\r\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\r\n      srcset=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ce6db4b-5349-484e-8739-ae5d7fe38f31\" />\r\n    <img\r\n      src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ce6db4b-5349-484e-8739-ae5d7fe38f31\" />\r\n  </picture>\r\n</div>\r\n", "assets": [{"name": "HyperPMChoose-2.0.0.7-release.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/io.github.howard20181.hyperos.pmunlock/releases/download/7-2.0.0/HyperPMChoose-2.0.0.7-release.apk", "size": 45559, "downloadCount": 140}]}, {"tagName": "10-2.1.1", "name": "v2.1.1", "createdAt": "2026-03-25T19:19:55Z", "body": "修复上个版本写漏 deoptimize 导致模块不生效的问题\r\nFixed an issue in the previous version where a missing deoptimize statement caused modules to malfunction.", "assets"